The '''Balisca national football team''' ({{Lang-bl|Seleción de futbol de Balisca}}) represents the [[Baliscan Confederation]] in {{W|international football}}, and is controlled by the [[Baliscan Football Federation]] ({{lang-bl|Federación Baliscana de Futbol}}). The team's colors are black and white. The national Baliscan team is collectively known as ''Las Jaguars'' (The Jaguars).

